  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-898;
  :comment " The text explicitly states that iron production is \"regulated to prioritize the army's needs, with any surplus allocated to private industry,\" demonstrating a clear hierarchy of resource distribution during a period of conflict.";
