  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1613;
  :comment " The text describes the immense costs of the war as so staggering that they would unnerve even a \"hot-blooded Poincarist\" and astonish \"the most sober man of facts\" in France, implying a shift in public sentiment due to financial strain during or immediately after World War I.";
  :id "d648d653-b0bd-4f95-bb55-422bb19c0336";
