:rel-6917529027641083451 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1547;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1595;
  :comment " Cadorna's daily order, largely unnoticed, speaks of a hundred victories against the centuries-old enemy, indicating a narrative of success and progress being pushed by military leaders.";
  :id "17eab6fb-fb04-40ae-822b-70f1d2243724";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083457 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1547;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1601;
  :comment " The observation that the neutralists remained very quiet suggests a suppression or marginalization of dissenting voices regarding the war.";
  :id "e7f2f2a7-9333-4fd8-a793-74a1d40cfcb2";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083462 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1547;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1606;
  :comment " The Corriere della Sera's comparison of Cadorna's dignified language with the Austrian Crown Prince's order, which supposedly revealed the entire backwardness of his Teutonic race, indicates the use of racial slurs to denigrate the enemy and reinforce national identity.";
  :id "189d9fb0-057f-40d9-8e16-ef0c1b1eb559";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083467 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1547;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1611;
  :comment " The descriptions of parades, music, flags, and speeches in Rome, Naples, and Messina on the anniversary of the war declaration clearly show a public celebration of the conflict by certain factions.";
  :id "4887b699-d0b4-44e4-aac5-9a65c301dbd1";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

