:rel-1152921504606848537 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1567;
  :comment " Jowett is mentioned as a Member of Parliament and chairman, giving a speech at the Congress of the Independent Labour Party.";
  :id "e9598752-57d1-498e-b6fa-25415f125c31";
  :type " MENTIONS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083456 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1600;
  :comment " Jowett highlights that the British public was kept uninformed about foreign policy events, contrasting this with Wilson's transparency with the American people.";
  :id "73b5b052-9cbd-46bc-a064-02bb9930cf68";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083458 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1602;
  :comment " The interrupters accuse Wilson of representing capitalist interests rather than the working class, indicating a perception from English working class.";
  :id "55185010-9b04-4545-baa1-f6808c1ec7a8";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083463 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1607;
  :comment " Jowett criticizes the Allies for not stating they sought no conquests or war indemnities, suggesting this prolonged the conflict.";
  :id "ec09c210-79cd-44bb-ad41-71af05538bbe";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083468 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1612;
  :comment " Jowett's speech is interrupted and he is labeled a \"belligerent pacifist,\" indicating resistance to pacifist views.";
  :id "a2694b7c-29a0-4726-a3ca-4c1931d30382";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083471 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1615;
  :comment " Jowett implies that greater transparency in foreign policy might have prevented World War I.";
  :id "e8416ae8-23d1-492c-8d58-ed2f668f01aa";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083475 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1619;
  :comment " The text suggests Wilson's transparency with the American public about foreign policy is a model that Jowett believes, if adopted by the British government, could have altered the course of the war.";
  :id "abe0ea72-5d45-4778-a6ca-2577fc9e8f3f";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083480 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1624;
  :comment " The interjectors' claim that Wilson represents only capitalist interests indicates a specific skepticism from a British labor perspective regarding American leadership and its proclaimed ideals.";
  :id "92ec438b-cb95-4014-92aa-70b259c01ca1";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083486 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1630;
  :comment " Jowett, speaking as chairman of the Independent Labour Party, advocates for a declaration of no conquests or indemnities, indicating the party's stance on post-war settlement.";
  :id "1ba71935-b95f-4d1f-b5bf-9fa31f9530c4";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083491 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1635;
  :comment " The term \"belligerent pacifist\" used to describe Jowett and Wilson represents a rhetorical tactic used by their opponents to discredit their anti-war positions.";
  :id "0bab3b11-70fa-48a6-b92f-c974b4037dd8";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641083495 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-1561;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1639;
  :comment " Jowett's argument that the war would not have materialized if Britain had limited its actions to defending rights and sovereignty reflects an internal debate within British politics about the war's origins and its continued justification.";
  :id "24e9084b-f41a-4b39-9364-d80b0655cb1d";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

