  owl:annotatedSource :node-1590;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-1631;
  :comment " The text highlights the financial difficulties faced by homeowners due to wartime legislation.Wives' Misconceptions about Rent Obligations during Wartime: The text specifically refutes the mistaken belief held by some wives that war abolishes rent obligations.Mediation for Wartime Rent Disputes in Greater Berlin: The text advises wives who cannot pay full rent to seek an agreement through a district leader's mediation.Variability in Municipal Rent Subsidy Principles in Greater Berlin: The text notes that the principles for rental subsidies vary considerably among individual municipalities.Violations of Municipal Rent Resolutions in Greater Berlin: A representative from the Magistracy clarifies that demands for specific rent reductions by commissions directly violated municipal resolutions.";
  :id "1f5273a4-a65d-4d8c-8022-c164670aa7ac";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

