:rel-6917529027641084861 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-2971;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-3005;
  :comment " Austria-Hungary is described as employing a \"defensive war\" strategy, indicating its specific military and political posture during a conflict.";
  :id "a31081b4-d630-4a3e-bd76-c6ce4584d551";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641084864 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-2971;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-3008;
  :comment " The safeguarding of \"honor\" and \"reputation\" of citizens and the monarchy is a central theme in Austria-Hungary's diplomatic response, reflecting a key national value.";
  :id "88400e03-09d4-4c8a-a741-0ffde8c58c74";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641084868 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-2971;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-3012;
  :comment " Austria-Hungary's confidence is bolstered by a belief in \"divine and just support,\" suggesting a moral and religious justification for its actions.";
  :id "0ff0f67e-e4cc-4c48-80a7-47ea462268ab";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641084872 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-2971;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-3016;
  :comment " The statement \"the White House is not a global Supreme Court and its verdict is not definitive\" directly challenges the perceived global authority of the United States by Austria-Hungary.";
  :id "199d4067-ebd6-498d-ac68-e3b4c94bd705";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641084877 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-2971;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-3021;
  :comment " The claim of \"divine and just support\" and the focus on \"honor, reputation, and existence\" serve to portray Austria-Hungary's position as morally superior and unassailable.";
  :id "290cacb3-4709-4af2-b748-2f1e464d9707";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641084881 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-2971;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-3025;
  :comment " Austrian newspapers universally dismiss the American note as \"insufficient justification\" and an \"inadequately substantiated accusation,\" indicating a narrative of victimhood and dismissal of foreign claims.";
  :id "15a3ee94-d55f-4d94-b13f-ff7578560a95";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641084885 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-2971;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-3029;
  :comment " Austria-Hungary's readiness for \"calm, unbiased negotiations\" is contingent upon the United States providing \"proof,\" thus shifting the burden of evidence and control of the diplomatic process.";
  :id "0abde662-96f0-4a37-ab98-59d4488c0928";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

:rel-6917529027641084891 a owl:Axiom;
  owl:annotatedSource :node-2971;
  owl:annotatedProperty :LINKS;
  owl:annotatedTarget :node-3035;
  :comment " The parallel drawn between the American note and an accusation that \"even a minor court would dismiss\" highlights Austria-Hungary's rejection of the United States' presumed judicial authority in international affairs.";
  :id "d9d69dec-5401-4308-ae8a-c3c8eb1a3020";
  :type "CLAIMS";
  :created_by "AI_INGEST" .

